            "scoreKey": "involvement",
            "headline": "Involvement: reflecting on this class",
            "source": {
              "type": "score_only"
            },
            "summary": "This describes how often you experience opportunities to discuss ideas, ask questions and explain your thinking. A higher mean means you reported these activities more often; speaking less does not mean you care less about learning. The displayed value is the mean of eight complete responses on a 1–5 frequency scale. There are no high/low categories or comparison norms.",
